<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xmsbt>
  <entry label="nam_chr0_00_conker">
    <text>Conker</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_chr1_00_conker">
    <text>Conker</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_chr2_00_conker">
    <text>CONKER</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_chr3_00_conker">
    <text>CONKER</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_stage_name_00_conker">
    <text>King of All the Land</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_lower_00_conker">
    <text>Context Sensitive</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_lower_help_00_conker">
    <text>Stands on a Pad with a lightbulb. 
Inputting the move again allows Conker 
to do multiple different things.
</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_normal_00_conker">
    <text>Slingshot</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_normal_help_00_conker">
    <text> Shoots a Nut from a slingshot. 
Holding Up-right or down-right 
will angle the shot.</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_side_00_conker">
    <text>Mr. Barrel</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_side_help_00_conker">
    <text>Goes for a ride. Can jump off to 
let it roll for a set distance.</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_upper_00_conker">
    <text>Tail Thing</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_special_upper_help_00_conker">
    <text>Flies into the air with tail. 
Slowly descends to the ground 
after main boost.</text>
  </entry>
    <entry label="nam_peculiar_00_conker">
    <text>Context Sensitive</text>
  </entry>
    <entry label="nam_peculiar_help_00_conker">
    <text>Depending on where or what is happening to Conker during a match, 
Context Sensitive will become different things.

Inputting the move once will activate the search, inputting it again will 
perform an action based off the following scenarios: 

■ Crossbow (No specific event): Conker shoots an arrow from a crossbow.
■ Counter (When Hit): Conker stuns the opponent. The stun is stronger at higher percents.
■ Reflector (Near Projectile): Conker bats the projectile away.
■ Anvil (Aerial, Onstage): Conker transforms into an anvil and plummets onto the ground.
■ Jetpack (Aerial, Offstage): Conker equips a jetpack and flies forward.</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_final_arts_conker">
    <text>Programmer's Arsenal</text>
  </entry>
  <entry label="nam_final_arts_help_conker">
    <text>Conker hits the opponent so hard 
that it freezes the game. He then unleashes a 
flurry of attacks and finishes with a 
giant katana slash to send them fliyng!</text>
  </entry>
</xmsbt>